  "evidence": "TEXT_D: 1p Income Tax rise ringfenced for NHS and care; mental health parity and crisis care; uprate benefits, scrap bedroom tax and rape clause; carers' rights; oppose a second Scottish independence referendum; pro‑UN/NATO and maintain a minimum nuclear deterrent; defend HRA/ECHR; eliminate day‑to‑day deficit by 2020; fair‑tax and anti‑avoidance measures; support SMEs/entrepreneurs and modernise gig‑economy rights; strong green laws and clean air plan. TEXT_G: Increase NHS funding; living wage, ban zero‑hours, equal pay enforcement; end sanctions, benefit freeze, scrap two‑child cap/rape clause, abolish Bedroom Tax; humane asylum and maintain 0.7% aid; Scotland’s interests first and a choice on independence; abolish House of Lords and replace FPTP; scrap Trident; balance current budget by 2021/22; higher additional tax rate and restore bank levy; invest in renewables and oppose Hinkley C.",
